    "detailed_description": "Welcome to the tower defense game. You stand on the defense of the castle against the constantly approaching enemy forces.<br />\r\nTry your hand at the strategy genre where you have to fight for your lands.<br />\r\nYou control small squads of fighters with different characteristics.<br />\r\nSome fight in close combat and have more health, others attack from afar and are very vulnerable.<br />\r\nYour task is to destroy all enemies on the map. Farms will supply you with provisions with which you can recruit new soldiers.<br />\r\nGather squads, hire new soldiers, capture farms... All this will help you win!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Dynamic gameplay<br />\r\n-Dangerous enemies<br />\r\n-Interesting gameplay",
